metamusic worker image - third-party notices

This image contains the YuE2 VAE weights, baked in at build time so that the endpoint needs only one cached
model (the 3B model, which is NOT in the image):

  Model:     YuE2-Vae
  Source:    https://huggingface.co/m-a-p/YuE2-Vae  (pinned revision: see VAE_REVISION in worker/Dockerfile)
  Creators:  multimodal-art-projection (m-a-p) and the YuE2 licensors
