             https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
             with the individual-creator permission and the academic-use terms of the YuE2 MODEL_LICENSE
             https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/blob/main/MODEL_LICENSE
  Changes:   none (files are verified byte-for-byte against the SHA-256 listed by Hugging Face)

The weights are used for non-commercial, individual creative use under those terms. The licence text,
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and the licenses/ directory of the model repository are kept next to the weights in
/opt/mm/hf-cache/hub/models--m-a-p--YuE2-Vae/snapshots/<revision>/.

The image also installs the yue2 inference code (multimodal-art-projection/YuE, pinned commit in
worker/contract/YUE2_COMMIT, Apache-2.0) and Python packages under their own licences (see
/opt/venv/freeze.txt for the list).
